//! Hand-written wire views keep only app-read fields, with Endpoint constants beside their payloads; endpoint.rs maps oRPC to HTTP.
//! Unknown fields are ignored; unknown or unreadable enum/union variants become Other. Tests must pin known samples to their exact variant.
//! tests/wire validates round-tripped values against contract.lock.json and api.schema.json (generated by scripts/api-schemas.mjs).
//! Payloads not yet drawn natively remain serde_json::Value inside typed envelopes; lenient.rs preserves forward compatibility.

